# Frontend

- UI consumes typed domain contracts.
- Do not query SQLite directly.
- Do not call the analyzer localhost server directly from the renderer.
- Do not build raw CS2 console commands in the UI.
- Do not calculate authoritative coaching rules in UI components.
- Separate server/job state from ephemeral view state.
- Render AI facts, observations, inferences, recommendations and uncertainties as distinct concepts.
- Severity and confidence are different fields and must not be visually conflated.
- Always show a clear failure/retry state for parse, CS2, capture and AI operations.
